                <div class="sc-action">
                  <a href="/brand/feimao/" class="sc-btn">查看飞猫云评测 →</a>
                  <span class="sc-coupon">优惠码：<code>flycat888</code></span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 目录导览导航锚点 -->
        <div class="article-toc-box">
          <h3 class="toc-title">📑 专著级长文目录大纲 (点击直达相应板块)</h3>
          <div class="toc-grid">
            <a href="#lines-comparison">第一篇：跨境物理链路与传输拓扑深度拆解 (IEPL/IPLC/BGP)</a>
            <a href="#protocols-evolution">第二篇：代理加密协议演进史与 2026 抗封锁对抗实录</a>
